# Planetary reference assets are integrity-checked byte-for-byte: every
# registration.json pins SHA-256 hashes of dem.tif, metadata.json and
# preview.png. Git must never rewrite their line endings (core.autocrlf or
# text=auto would change metadata.json bytes on Linux/macOS checkouts and the
# registry would reject the reference). Store and check out exactly as approved.
backend/references/** -text

# Binary rasters and images
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# Files executed inside Linux containers must keep LF endings everywhere.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
